		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Croaking, winged toad- dragon, worshipped by boggards as vile gods. 18 feet tall, weighs 6 tons. Endless appetite for man-flesh.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 13, <strong>HP</strong> 31, <strong>ATK</strong> 3 bite +5 (2d6) and 1 tongue or croak, <strong>MV</strong> near (fly, swim), <strong>S</strong> +4, <strong>D</strong> +1, <strong>C</strong> +4, <strong>I</strong> -2, <strong>W</strong> +0, <strong>Ch</strong> +1, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 6</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Croak</strong>. All within double near who can hear, CHA 15+ or stunned 1d4 rounds. Cannot use again for 1d4 rounds.</p><p></p><p><strong>Tongue</strong>. 1 creature in double near DEX 15+ or pulled to close range.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
